#lem: X; kituš[dwelling place]; diŋir[deity]; name[any]; X; X
#tr.en: …… fixes the months and the new moon according to a cord (?), 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.5

1.A.A.6. [...] mah en kur ki-gub-ba a-a {d}nanna# [...]
#lem: X; mah[great]; en[lord]; kur[mountain(s)]; kigub[station]; aya[father]; Nanna[1]DN; X
#tr.en: establishes the year ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.6

1.A.A.7. [...] itid# ud-sakar gu-a gen₆-ne₂ mu ki-bi#-[še₃ X-ŋar]
#lem: X; itud[moon]; udsakar[crescent moon]; gu[cord]; gin[confirm]; mu[year]; ki[place]; ŋar[put]
#tr.en: …… life for the multitudes ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.7

1.A.A.8. [...] X uŋ₃ lu!#-a nam-til₃ [...]
#lem: X; X; uŋ[people]; lu[abundant]; namtil[life]; X
#tr.en: …… who puts all the lands in order, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.8

