#lem: Idigna[1 Tigris]; Buranun[1 Euphrates]; a[water]; zal[pass time]; tum[bring]; X; kur[mountain(s)]
#tr.en: …… fine grain ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.10

1.A.A.11. [...] X še gu-nu [...]
#lem: X; X; še[barley]; gunu[qualification of barley]; X
#tr.en: …… lush vegetation in the spacious land ……, 
#etcsl: line-id=1.A.A.11

